 a sun shelf and a travertine deck beside a dark patio cover, with palms and a basketball hoop.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-6/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-06.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with a sun shelf and a travertine deck beside a dark patio cover, with palms and a basketball hoop.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-5/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Pool with a raised spa wall and a travertine deck behind a two-story home, with a pergola at the back of the yard.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-5/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with a raised spa wall and a travertine deck behind a two-story home, with a pergola at the back of the yard.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico-resto\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-4/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-04.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Aerial view of a long L-shaped pool with a square spa and a gray deck on an open lot with a pasture beyond.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-4/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a long L-shaped pool with a square spa and a gray deck on an open lot with a pasture beyond.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-3/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-03.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Pool with a sun shelf, loungers in the water and a raised square spa on a light travertine deck.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-3/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-03.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with a sun shelf, loungers in the water and a raised square spa on a light travertine deck.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-2/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-02.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Aerial view of a pool and raised spa beside a two-story home with a white pergola, palms and a travertine deck.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-2/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-02.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a pool and raised spa beside a two-story home with a white pergola, palms and a travertine deck.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"946\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-1/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-01.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Rectangular pool with a raised spa and sun shelf on a travertine deck, stepping pads in the lawn and a basketball hoop.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-1/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-01.jpg\" alt=\"Rectangular pool with a raised spa and sun shelf on a travertine deck, stepping pads in the lawn and a basketball hoop.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-local mm-local--sin\"><div class=\"mm-local-caja\"><div class=\"mm-local-txt\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Where we build in Marion County</h2><p class=\"mm-local-dato\">Marion County is in North Florida; 3 of its cities have their own custom pool page.</p><div class=\"mm-faq-lista mm-local-faq\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Who pulls the pool permit in Marion County?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>We do, under our Florida pool contractor license. A new inground pool needs one building permit from the city or county office that has jurisdiction over your property; it covers the shell, the deck, the electrical work and the plumbing, each inspected at its own stage. We prepare the submittal, pull the permit and coordinate every inspection through to a closed permit at start-up.</p><p class=\"mm-faq-fuentes mm-faq-enlace\"><a href=\"/blogs/what-permits-are-required-for-pool-construction-in-florida\">What Permits Are Required for Pool Construction in Florida?</a></p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How long does it take to build a custom pool in Marion County?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>There is no single number: the calendar depends on the permit office, the season and the scope. What is fixed is the order of the phases and the cure time of concrete and plaster, which no crew can shorten. After the design is approved and the permit is submitted, you get a schedule for your own project, updated at every inspection.</p><p class=\"mm-faq-fuentes mm-faq-enlace\"><a href=\"/blogs/pool-construction-timeline-in-florida-what-to-expect-from-start-to-finish\">Pool Construction Timeline in Florida: What to Expect From Start to Finish</a></p></div></details></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-3d\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">3D Pool Design &amp; Visualization</h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Preview your custom pool and outdoor space in detailed 3D before construction begins, allowing confident planning, precise execution, and alignment before permitting.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea mm-btn--linea-inv\" href=\"/request-estimated\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><figure class=\"mm-3d-medio\"><div data-poster-url=\"/images/site/bg-video-3d-poster.0000000.jpg\" data-video-urls=\"/videos/bg-video-3d-mp4.mp4,/videos/bg-video-3d-webm.webm\" data-autoplay=\"true\" data-loop=\"true\" data-wf-ignore=\"true\" class=\"background-video-3d w-background-video w-background-video-atom\"><video id=\"530cbcaa-1f3f-21e1-a774-0f91a89c10ec-video\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" style=\"background-image:url(/images/site/bg-video-3d-poster.0000000.jpg)\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" data-wf-ignore=\"true\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"><source src=\"/videos/bg-video-3d-mp4.mp4\" data-wf-ignore=\"true\"><source src=\"/videos/bg-video-3d-webm.webm\" data-wf-ignore=\"true\"></video><noscript><style>\n  [data-wf-bgvideo-fallback-img] {\n    display: none;\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    [data-wf-bgvideo-fallback-img] {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: -100;\n      display: inline-block;\n      height: 100%;\n      width: 100%;\n      object-fit: cover;\n    }\n  }</style><img data-wf-bgvideo-fallback-img=\"true\" src=\"/images/site/bg-video-3d-poster.0000000.jpg\" alt=\"\"></noscript><div aria-live=\"polite\"><button type=\"button\" data-w-bg-video-control=\"true\" aria-controls=\"530cbcaa-1f3f-21e1-a774-0f91a89c10ec-video\" class=\"w-backgroundvideo-backgroundvideoplaypausebutton w-background-video--control\"><span><img src=\"/images/site/pause.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Pause video\"></span><span hidden=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Play video\" src=\"/images/site/play-24.svg\"></span></button></div></div></figure></section><section class=\"mm-proc mm-proc--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Comprehensive Outdoor Living <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We deliver each project with precision, transparency, and minimal disruption to your operations.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"/request-estimated\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><ol class=\"mm-pasos mm-pasos--sin-num\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">1. Design &amp; Planning</h3><p>We begin with a personalized consultation and site evaluation to understand your vision and outdoor space. Our team develops a complete 3D design to visualize the project and ensure every element works together seamlessly before construction begins.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">2. Permits &amp; Site Preparation</h3><p>We handle all engineering, permits, and approvals required in Florida. Once approved, we prepare the site with proper excavation, structural framing, and foundational work to ensure long-term durability and safety.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">3. Construction &amp; Finishes</h3><p>Our team completes all structural and installation work with precision, followed by high-quality finishes and materials. From integrated features to equipment, electrical, and safety requirements, every detail is built to meet the highest standards.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">4. Final Inspection &amp; Handover</h3><p>We complete the project with a detailed inspection and walkthrough, ensuring everything meets our quality, safety, and craftsmanship standards. Once approved, your outdoor space is ready to enjoy with confidence and peace of mind.</p></li></ol></div></section>";
